  "canon:title": "The renal pathology in a case of lithium-induced diabetes insipidus.",
  "canon:abstract": "A case of lithium-induced diabetes insipidus is reported. At necropsy microscopy shoed unique and extensive damage to cells lining the distal nephron. It is suggested that these changes represent a specific toxic effect of lithium, reported here for the first time in man.",
  "canon:text": "The renal pathology in a case of lithium-induced diabetes insipidus. A case of lithium-induced diabetes insipidus is reported. At necropsy microscopy shoed unique and extensive damage to cells lining the distal nephron. It is suggested that these changes represent a specific toxic effect of lithium, reported here for the first time in man.",
